    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe aebele Mose ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Panga amapenga yabili aya silifa ayo bafulila ku nondo ayakwitilako ulukuta lonse ulwa bena Israeli pamo no kubeshibishako pakufuma pa nkambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga balisha amapenga yonse yabili, ulukuta lwa bena Israeli lonse ninshi kwisa longana pantanshi yobe pa mwinshi we Tenti Lyakukumaninamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga limofye elyalila, ninshi intungulushi, abakalamba ba nko sha bena Israeli, eshili nokulongana pantanshi yobe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likalati ipenga nga lyalila, ninshi inko shacitile inkambi ku kabanga kwima ukufuma pa nkambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo kabili ipenga lyabubili lyalila inko shacitile inkambi shabela ku kapinda ka ku kulyo nasho shili nokufuma pa nkambi. Kanshi ukulisha kwe penga kukaba e cishibilo cakufuma pa nkambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pakwita abantu bonse pamo mulelisha amapenga, lelo likalalila umusowa umo wine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamwana Aroni abaume, bashimapepo, ebafwile ukulisha amapenga. Ili e funde muli nokukonka umukakonkanina inkulo shenu shonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo mwalalwa inkondo no mulwani wenu uukalamucusha mu calo cenu, mukaleikatisha ukulisha amapenga, na Yawe Lesa wenu akamwibukisha no kumupususha ku balwani benu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili mukalelisha amapenga na pa nshita shenu ishakusansamuka, pa nshikunkulu ishasontwa, na pa nshikunkulu yakutampa umweshi upya. Mukalelisha amapenga pakuleka amalambo yakoca na pakupeela umutuulo wakwampana. Ifi fikaba ifyakumwibukishako kuli Yawe Lesa wenu. Nine Yawe Lesa wenu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa bushiku bwalenga amakumi yabili (20), mu mweshi wabubili, mu mwaka walenga bubili, ikumbi lyalimine ukufuma pe Tenti lyakwa Lesa ilya Cipangano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abena Israeli nabo epakwima ukufuma pa nkambi ya mu matololo ya Sinai, balati bafuma apa baya pambi mpaka ikumbi lyaiminina mu matololo ya Parani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baimine no kuya umuku wakubalilapo ukulingana nefyo Yawe akonkomeshe Mose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba mu ciputulwa ca nkambi yakwa Yuda ebabalilepo ukwima no luunga lwabo, baleba mu mpuka mu mpuka. Uwalebatungulula ni Nashoni mwana Aminadabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netaneli mwana Sua, nao ewaletungulula impuka ya luko lwakwa Isaka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kabili Eliabu mwana Eloni, nao aletungulula impuka ya luko lwakwa Sebuloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo bapangulula Itenti lyakwa Lesa, abena Geshoni na bena Merari abalelisenda nabo baima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalekonkapo ukwima ba mu ciputulwa ca nkambi yakwa Rubeni no luunga lwabo, mu mpuka mu mpuka. Uwalebatungulula ni Elisuli mwana Shedeuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shelumieli mwana Sulishadai, ewaletungulula impuka ya luko lwakwa Simeoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kabili Eliasafu mwana Deweli, nao ewaletungulula impuka ya luko lwakwa Gadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo abena Koati baima, basenda ifyamushilo. Itenti lyakwa Lesa bali nokusanga naliimikwa kale libe tabalafika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalekonkapo ukwima ba mu ciputulwa ca nkambi yakwa Efulemu no luunga lwabo, mu mpuka mu mpuka. Uwalebatungulula ni Elishama mwana Amiudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gamalieli mwana Pedasuri, ewaletungulula impuka ya luko lwakwa Manase, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kabili Abidani mwana Gideoni, nao alatungulula impuka ya luko lwakwa Benjamini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na pakulekelesha abaleshalila kunumafye ya bonse, ba mu ciputulwa ca nkambi yakwa Dani no luunga lwabo, nabo baima mu mpuka mu mpuka. Uwalebatungulula ni Aiesa mwana Amishadai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pafieli mwana Okirani, ewaletungulula impuka ya luko lwakwa Asheri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kabili Aila mwana Enani, nao aletungulula impuka ya luko lwakwa Naftali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi ifi efyo impuka sha bena Israeli shalekonkana pakwenda nga shafuma pa nkambi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Mose aebele Hobabu mwana Reueli umwina Midiani shifyala wakwa Mose ati, “Ifwe nomba twalaima ukuya ku ncende iyo Yawe atile, ‘Nkaipeela kuli imwe.’ Natuleya bonse na ifwe tukaya kucitila ubusuma, pantu Yawe alaya Israeli ifintu ifisuma.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hobabu nao ayaswike ati, “Awe, ine nshakonke, nalabwelelamofye ku calo candi, kabili ku bantu bandi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo Mose nao atile, “Napapata wiya utushe iyoo. Niwe wishibe apo twingacita inkambi mu matololo, kabili iwe kuti waba amenso yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga cakuti iwe twaya nobe, ninshi ifwe tukaya kwakanyako ifisuma fyonse ifyo Yawe akatupeela.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
