          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo lyonse Imbokoshi ya Cipangano yaleima Mose alesosa ati, “Ima, we Yawe! Abalwani bobe bengapasangana, na bakupata leka bafulumuke ku cinso cobe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili lyonsefye ilyo baletula Imbokoshi ya Cipangano, Mose alesosa ati, “Bwela, we Yawe ku mintapendwa ya makana yakwa Israeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.36",
